{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021122205367-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021134536\"/><p>事發在永星里1B號大廈一間賓館。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>今午(21日)12時12分，油麻地永星里1B號大廈一間旅舍，職員發現租客未有按時退房，遂以後備門匙開門查看，揭發該名姓曾(48歲)男租客昏迷在內，遂報案求助。救援人員接報到場，當場證實事主已經死亡。案件列作「屍體發現」，人員正就事件展開調查，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:59:50.706222+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:22:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:38:03.956272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:57:48.162499+00:00","content_hash":"f52cb70d0206641991378901c76d4122780a61c3db6dc259d5571c20aeb803cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}